           or s.visa_type_id = (select id from public.visa_types
                                 where visaai_id = 'dk-positive-list-higher-education'))
    order by s.visa_type_id nulls last
    limit 1),
  'you must be able to support yourself and your family during your stay. for instance, you are not allowed to receive benefits under the terms of the active social policy act – and there might be other benefits that you cannot receive.', 'You must be able to support yourself and your family during your stay. For instance, you are not allowed to receive benefits under the terms of the Active Social Policy Act – and there might be other benefits that you cannot receive.', 'manual', 1.00,
